Package: targetsboard
Title: Targets Board
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Athos", "Damiani", , "athos.damiani@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A board for the author of a 'targets' pipeline, to understand
    it while working on it: its structure, what is outdated, what each target
    produced and what a run is doing. Meant to replace targets::tar_watch()
    for the author.
